4449 0 obj
  << /ActualText (For rapid Prototyping MVP we can do\072\ndesign end to end pipeline architecture\056\nFocusing the system on data processing with emphasis on data integrity and audit readiness\054 to support critical use cases and decision\055making\056\nDelivering a working MVP with core functionality to validate market demand and gather feedback\056\n\034We build small\054 but we don\031t build messy\035\056 The system is designed with modularity in mind\054 making the transition to a scalable architecture much easier than starting from scratch\056\nManual bulk data input will be built into the system to support future international expansion\056\050 Since the structure of each source website can vary significantly\054 not all data can be reliably scraped automatically\056\050 This manual input functionality makes the system futureproof for global deployment\056\n\nAdditional Considerations \050Require more context\054 but generally feasible\051\072\nEnsuring the platform is futureproof and ready for international expansion\054 e\056g\056\054 to countries like Malaysia and Vietnam\056 \050need more context\051\056\nrobust logging and snapshop mechanism \050this requires clear examples and more detailed design to meet audit\057legal requirements\051\nscalability readiness can be performed into this project but not recomended\054 since scalability need modular approach\054 making each step as separate system will take time and effort\054 making it not cost efficient for MVP but feasible\056 we recommend a working MVP and extend the project if market test give positive result\056\n\nchallanging step but doable in the future\nintegrate the system with GIS tool to perform spatial overlay\056 this will need a separate project\057app to make a GIS tool integrated through proprietary system to make overlay map based on given data \050array of coordinate\051)
     /K [ 2042 ]
     /P 4450 0 R
     /Pg 384 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

4450 0 obj
  << /K [ 4449 0 R ]
     /P 6030 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 384 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

4451 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Development is expected to take approximately 3 to 4 months\054 but may be accelerated depending on project conditions and resource availability\056\n\n\351 Pain Points Solved by the MVP System\nEliminates time\055consuming manual due diligence processes\056\nSignificantly reduces risks caused by human error in manual data checks\056\nProvides audit\055ready and legally defensible audit logs\056\nReduces time and operational costs associated with manual workflows\056\n\n\n\027 Data Integration with Private and Government Websites\nIntegration with both private and government\055owned platforms can be facilitated through cooperation with the respective institutions\056\050 This collaboration can greatly simplify data acquisition and scraping\054 especially when legal access or structured APIs are made available\056)
     /K [ 2043 ]
     /P 4452 0 R
     /Pg 384 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

